OL,3,GNEWSAMcGill's accuse Swinney of
OL,4,Abehaving like dictator over bus plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major bus firm has accused First
OL,7,FMinister John Swinney of behaving like
OL,8,Fa dictator over his government's plans
OL,9,Fto bring buses under public control.
OL,11,FSandy Easdale, who owns McGill's
OL,12,Falongside his brother James, said
OL,13,FSwinney "appears to have transformed
OL,14,Finto the next Idi Amin or Robert
OL,15,FMugabe".
OL,17,F"Both men, incidentally, who bankrupted
OL,18,Ftheir countries through catastrophic
OL,19,Ffinancial policies," he added.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
