OL,3,GNEWSAMcGill's accuse Swinney of
OL,4,Abehaving like dictator over bus plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenny Gilruth, Swinney's deputy, said
OL,7,Fher government was "protecting" the
OL,8,Fpublic, who had faced a series of route
OL,9,Fclosures in recent years.
